
# Tame An Animal

>  Til Death Do Us Part?

---
Gain this advancement by taming and befriending an animal!

Now that you have a best friend forever, you'll want to keep them safe. The &bPet Bed&r allows your pets to &arespawn&r in the morning, should anything unpleasant happen to them. Simply have your pet &6set their spawn point&r by pushing them onto the &bPet Bed&r. It's a must have!

The following quests will explore some other options for empowering your buddy. 
            